     "id": 1168172,
     "content_html": "most governing authority lay with Congress"
    },
    {
     "id": 1168171,
     "content_html": "new federal entities, such as a national bank, required the approval of all three government branches"
    },
    {
     "id": 1168173,
     "content_html": "the Constitution could be loosely or broadly interpreted"
    },
    {
     "id": 1168170,
     "content_html": "the Constitution needed amending"
    }
